             /       SAVE USER'S DF IN D
             /       SET PROG DF TO F
             /       'GAME' IS SET UP AS CONTINUE ADDRESS (TRAD+1)
             /       EXECUTE THE INSTRUCTION (TRICKY)
             /       NOT ALL INSTRUCTIONS CAN BE SO EXECUTED
             /       CIF'S, INST BETWEEN CIF AND JMP
             /       INDIRECT REFERENCES TO AUTO-INDEX REGISTERS (NO ROOM)
             /       2-WORD INSTRUCTIONS
             /       ETC.
             /       INCREMENT CONTINUE COUNTER
