             /       FORM 'ION' OR 'IOF' DEPENDING ON WHETEHER ION OR IOF
             /               THEN IOF
             /       PRINT TRAD ( AC
             /       GOTO 'READ' WHICH RESTORES TRAP LOCATION

             /G SENDS TO 'JUMP'

             /JUMP:  MOVE 'WORD' TO 'GAME'
             /       STORE 'JMP I GAME' IN 'THE'
             /       CLEAR AC
             /       SET D=F
             /       SET CONTINUE COUNTER TO -1
             /       DO CR/LF
             /       CLEAR TTY FLAG
             /       GET CONTENTS OF TRAP LOCATION, STORE IN 'KEEP'
             /       RESTORE INTERRUPTS IF NECESSARY
             /XCONT: IF BREAKPOINT IN PROGRESS, REPLACE LOC BY 'JMP Z ZPAT'
             /       CHANGE DF AND IF TO D,F RESP.
             /       SET LOCATION 4,5,6 OF BREAKPOINT FIELD
             /       RESTORE L,AC
             /       EXECUTE THE INSTRUCTION AT LOCATION 'THE'
             /       CONTINUE
